CHAPTER.VERS:
Moreover he said to me, Son of man, eat what thou findest; 

          By which is meant that no one is fit to be God's messenger before he has received the word of God in his heart, as in (Eze_3:10) and has a zeal to it, and delight in it, as in (Jer_15:16; Rev_10:10).
         eat this scroll, and go speak to the house of Israel.
